OL,3,GNEWSANeighbour's sex assault left me   
OL,4,Aprisoner in my own home                
OL,6,FA woman who was sexually assaulted by  
OL,7,Fher neighbour has said she has become  
OL,8,F"a prisoner in her own home" after     
OL,9,Ftheir housing association, Abri, failed
OL,10,Fto move him as agreed.                 
OL,12,FThe woman, we are calling Helen, said: 
OL,13,F"It stops me doing everything I used to
OL,14,Fdo. I used to have a social life now I 
OL,15,Fdon't. He lives so close to me and I   
OL,16,Fcan't do anything about it."           
OL,18,FAbri manages more than 58,000          
OL,19,Fproperties across southern England,    
OL,20,Fincluding in Hampshire, Dorset,        
OL,21,FOxfordshire and Berkshire.             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
