OL,3,GNEWSANeighbour's sex assault left me   
OL,4,Aprisoner in my own home                
OL,6,FIt said it recognised the distress the 
OL,7,Fsituation had caused Helen and         
OL,8,Fexplained that the delay in moving her 
OL,9,Fneighbour was due to a shortage of     
OL,10,Fsuitable housing.                      
